{"version":1,"key":"card:440","content":{"id":440,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"11e8cb5f-25d3-459d-a728-99d37c81e2ef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"字符串格式化的方法。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"82189746-e97a-462e-905d-01a774221ecf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"%"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 左边指定一个字符串（格式字符串），并在右边指定要设置其格式的值。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"86011696-7ae2-4122-9b9a-728524e8c3d6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"899a8b9a-c339-42d7-8ef0-5ef68717d3a0","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> format = \"Hello, %s. %s enough for ya?\"\n>>> values = ('world', 'Hot')\n>>> format % values\n'Hello, world. Hot enough for ya?'","collabId":"22ca8e5c-80b9-4e9d-9b67-76970bb412be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c7e254d2-5d2a-429c-8aed-cac4e28d749e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模板字符串。它使用类似于 UNIX shell 的语法。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"dcd3f901-3065-4d43-9861-f66507e40094","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"f5242979-da0c-4b64-aec5-790088086731","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> from string import Template\n>>> tmpl = Template(\"Hello, $who! $what enough for ya?\")\n>>> tmpl.substitute(who=\"Mars\", what=\"Dusty\")\n'Hello, Mars! Dusty enough for ya?'","collabId":"3f337cd2-809f-4e93-87f0-a710b546556b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4a3d8ba3-fa6e-4036-843c-7e008a8caa1a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用字符串方法 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"format"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，每个替换字段都用花括号括起，其中可能包含名称，还可能包含有关如何对相应的值进行转换和格式设置的信息。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"15b16bdd-6ae7-4d29-93a7-31e685e53c77","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6c9d149d-811a-4816-ab87-70452b6f8946","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> \"{}, {} and {}\".format(\"first\", \"second\", \"third\")\n'first, second and third'\n\n>>> \"{0}, {1} and {2}\".format(\"first\", \"second\", \"third\")\n'first, second and third'","collabId":"1c1e9642-128c-475a-9441-d8e12b558d97","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"6dc19f85-2d10-499b-9463-abdc962805b1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8d2171ce-f422-4b48-8035-442ee89e9fbd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> \"{3} {0} {2} {1} {3} {0}\".format(\"be\", \"not\", \"or\", \"to\")\n'to be or not to be'","collabId":"51ce1a99-4930-4aaf-9224-370ea0009120","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"30c67f4b-ae4f-450e-bf6e-1e88cfa9dead","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果变量和替换字段同名，可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"f''"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的格式简写"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"663835e0-bfea-4209-8397-cc5bbc78d0ad","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5cba636a-ac91-447b-84dd-77660f1b095f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> from math import e\n>>> f\"Euler's constant is roughly {e}.\"\n\"Euler's constant is roughly 2.718281828459045.\"","collabId":"5f6c5cfe-ef22-406b-970f-cb65366dbffe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4cea13f7-eba6-4e2f-9d59-acea0c8f1f7d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可通过索引来指定要在哪个字段中使用相应的未命名参数，这样可不按顺序使用未命名参数。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"55da487a-ea5d-45c8-9125-0c106569cc0a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d543a8f6-a6d3-4bd0-ad67-dbdd97c4c48e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> \"{foo} {1} {bar} {0}\".format(1, 2, bar=4, foo=3)\n'3 2 4 1'","collabId":"2008732c-f02f-4444-b200-2d8271ba99f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"df6adaa8-af4b-4c62-a8d1-afef20002d1d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了可以使用提供的值本身，还可访问其组成部分"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"py","uuid":"2db6b0f9-1841-4a86-8036-a98b9f65b844","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8f4224fa-7c97-4fa7-b2bb-82fec0365553","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":">>> fullname = [\"Alfred\", \"Smoketoomuch\"]\n>>> \"Mr {name[1]}\".format(name=fullname)\n'Mr Smoketoomuch'\n\n>>> import math\n>>> tmpl = \"The {mod.__name__} module defines the value {mod.pi} for π\"\n>>> tmpl.format(mod=math)\n'The math module defines the value 3.141592653589793 for π'","collabId":"86de6114-5610-43fc-9276-9211731462eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Python/字符串/格式字符串"],"createTime":1719045064255,"updateTime":1743303640440,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640440}}